---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base title="Privacy" description="How the Proofed website and app handle your data.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap policy stack">
      <h1 class="display display-l">Privacy</h1>
      <p class="updated">Last updated 23 October 2026</p>

      <h2 class="heading">This website</h2>
      <p>This site uses no cookies, no analytics and no tracking scripts. Fonts are served from this site, not from a third party.</p>
      <p>The site is hosted on GitHub Pages. GitHub may record visitors' IP addresses for security purposes under its own privacy statement.</p>

      <h2 class="heading">Waitlist and pilot sign-ups</h2>
      <p>If you sign up, we keep your email address, the role you chose, and when you gave consent. We use them only to contact you about Proofed.</p>
      <p>We don't share them with anyone else. To have them deleted, reply to any email we send you and ask.</p>

      <h2 class="heading">The Proofed app</h2>
      <p>Your platform data and credentials stay on your device. Our servers never see your password, your raw platform data or the facts you prove.</p>
      <p>When you share a link, we store only an encrypted copy that we can't read. The key to open it is part of the link you send, and never reaches us.</p>

      <h2 class="heading">Your rights</h2>
      <p>You can ask to see, correct or delete any personal data we hold about you.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>

<style>
  .policy h2 {
    margin-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .updated {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
</style>
